N1  - <p>BOINC criterion evidence - Abstract, verbatim: "In an attempt to discover radio-quiet gamma-ray MSPs, we used the aggregated power from the computers of tens of thousands of volunteers participating in the Einstein@Home distributed computing project to search for pulsations from unidentified gamma-ray sources in Fermi Large Area Telescope data." | Link: discovery - first radio-quiet gamma-ray millisecond pulsar, found in Fermi-LAT data | Source: Science Advances (2018); DOI 10.1126/sciadv.aao7228</p>
