N1  - <p>BOINC criterion evidence - Abstract, verbatim: "Our search is designed to use the volunteer computing project Einstein@Home for a few months and assumes the sensitivity and duty cycles of the advanced LIGO detectors during their first science run." | Link: method - grid setup for directed searches in Advanced LIGO O1 data | Source: Physical Review D (2018); DOI 10.1103/PhysRevD.97.024051</p>
